# No credentials are required to build or import the Teams demo integration.
#
# This demo has no real Microsoft Teams connection — the Teams channel list is
# faked and there is no OAuth step (see src/configPages.ts). The only connection
# it uses is the org-scoped "Acme Connection", which is set with an API key via
# the setup script, not through environment variables:
#
#   npm run setup:connections -- --api-key <your-acme-api-key>
#
# (Contrast with ../slack/.env.example, where the Slack integration needs real
# SLACK_CLIENT_ID / SLACK_CLIENT_SECRET / SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET values.)
